      "date": "2026-05-27T15:35:00.000Z",
      "title": "Swan Defence and Heavy Industries Limited Announces CFO Changes",
      "body": "Swan Defence and Heavy Industries Limited at the meeting held on 27 May, 2026, Mr. Rajesh Bhardwaj has resigned from his position as Chief Financial Officer of the Company due to organisational restructuring and the strengthening of the Company’s finance leadership framework, effective from the close of business hours on May 27, 2026. Mr. Jignesh Shah has been appointed as the Chief Financial Officer of the Company with effect from May 28, 2026. Pursuant to the provisions of Section 203 of the Companies Act, 2013 and the applicable rules thereunder, he has also been designated as a Key Managerial Personnel of the Company. Mr. Shah brings over 27 years of experience in financial management, including more than 15 years in leadership roles. He possesses diverse experience across shipbuilding",
