      "body": "Swan Defence and Heavy Industries Limited announced that Mr. Ashishkumar Bairagra (DIN: 00049591) has tendered his resignation from the position of Independent Director with effect from February 20, 2026. The resignation was due to personal difficulty at this point in time. Mr. Ashishkumar Bairagra has confirmed that there are no other material reasons for his resignation other than those mentioned in his resignation letter. Mr. Ashishkumar Bairagra does not hold directorship in any listed entity.",
